# --- Generated data --------------------------------------------------------
# The pipeline is reproducible from src/data_generator.py with RANDOM_SEED = 42,
# so the ledger itself is not version controlled. The reports and charts under
# outputs/ ARE committed: they are the evidence behind the README.
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal

